":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-05-14T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"yQTCxEWXkME","position":10,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"SZA - Ice.Moon","track":{"id":"_S8GKu1JZwk","path":"/artists/sza/tracks/ice-moon/","slug":"icemoon","title":"Ice.Moon","artist":{"slug":"sza","title":"SZA"},"artwork":"images/artists/sza/tracks/ice-moon.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"A-2xaCFrXnk","slug":"150","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-150-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #150 w/ SOSUPERSAM","artwork":"/images/episodes/150.jpg","content":"Talented & vibrant woman SOSUPERSAM finally came through the studio. \n\n<!--more-->\nIt's been a long time coming and we're happy that you finally get a feel for who she is musically and as a person. Wasn't quite sure what she was gonna play for us, but she showed a great diversity and really brought us back to a place that was very much needed towards the end of her set. She's even cooler as a person. Being humble and driven will always get you far. Joe Kay really brought out a diverse selection of music. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-02T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"SOSUPERSAM's Set","position":1}},{"id":"GUqi-hpLFI0","position":6,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"SZA - Babylon (Swish Remix)","track":{"id":"0ByleEWq6a8","path":"/artists/sza/tracks/babylon-swish-remix/","slug":"babylon-swish-remix","title":"Babylon (Swish Remix)","artist":{"slug":"sza","title":"SZA"},"artwork":"images/artists/sza/tracks/babylon-swish-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"laWaR2BCPmc","slug":"185","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-185-w-fortune"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #185 w/ Fortune